ed for unsafe old-allocation read; atoi/atol/atoll and all CRT/stdio/time/locale replacement surfaces omitted.");("s";"No gdtoa/openlibm/printf submodule or build-time fetch. malloc/free are provided by host/application.");("s";"Public wide character input uses explicitly fixed 32-bit lmx_ea_wint_t and lmx_ea_wchar_t, independent of host wchar_t width.");("s";"strtoll/strtoull saturate on overflow without errno. Valid bases are 0 or 2..36. ASCII alphabetic digit conversion in strtoull is repaired in the guarded build view.");("s";"rand/srand and strtok have process-global state; rand_r and strtok_r allow actor-owned state. Unicode tables have the version supplied by the pinned upstream source, not a promise of latest Unicode.");("s";"calloc multiplication-overflow threshold uses size_t instead of unsigned long for LLP64 portability. GNU aliasing optimizations are disabled for isolated renamed builds.");("s";"Guarded build view corrects signed Unicode range comparisons and supplementary-plane case direction, uses the distinct wide-table index in wcwidth, and replaces host wcschr use with an explicit 32-bit whitespace scan. Wide API input must be a valid Unicode scalar; retained tables are not a complete Unicode conformance guarantee."))));("paths";("l";(("s";"vendor/ea_libc");("s";"extensions/bundles_extra/include/lmx_ea_libc.h"))));("public_headers";("l";(("s";"extensions/bundles_extra/include/lmx_ea_libc.h"))));("selected_profile";("s";"80 explicitly prefixed functions: ASCII/Unicode classification, memory/string algorithms, sorting/search, integer conversion, arithmetic, pseudo-random, two absolute-value math functions"));("source_archives";("l";(("d";(("names";("l";(("s";"ea_libc-6f23cc0848d10d93b35c4ecafeff4d10f0b81795.tar.gz"))));("sha256";("s";"d257499668c232426179446b9d690bc6abfbb70815166dd29c8ab96a008f45e9")))))));("source_selection_manifest";("s";"extensions/bundles_extra/ea_sources.cmake"));("source_validation";("s";"source_census_only_not_link_test"));("surface_patterns";("l";(("s";"extensions/bundles_extra/include/lmx_ea_libc.h"))));("targets";("l";(("s";"LMX::ea_libc"))));("urls";("l";(("s";"https://github.com/embeddedartistry/libc/tree/6f23cc0848d10d93b35c4ecafeff4d10f0b81795");("s";"https://codeload.github.com/embeddedartistry/libc/tar.gz/6f23cc0848d10d93b35c4ecafeff4d10f0b81795"))));("version";("s";"snapshot 6f23cc0848d1"))))
